    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2078790/extras/61817f8d815eafb76332c3e0a994f165.avif?t=1742648519\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to <strong>Kubitoz</strong> \u2013 an exhilarating 3D adventure where you take control of a cube navigating through a series of challenging obstacle courses. Each level presents unique difficulties and mechanics designed to keep you on the edge of your seat. With its simple yet charming cartoony 3D style, Kubitoz offers a visually delightful and engaging experience for players of all ages.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>~Fast-Paced Challenge of Reflexes and Strategy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> In <strong>Kubitoz</strong>, your primary objective is to dodge obstacles and reach the end of each level. The game is designed to be challenging, pushing your reflexes and strategic thinking to the limit. As you progress, you'll encounter new mechanics that add layers of fun and complexity to the gameplay, ensuring that no two levels feel the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2078790/extras/fff81f2151903d97ed83c4099bf81191.poster.avif?t=1742648519\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2078790/extras/fff81f2151903d97ed83c4099bf81191.webm?t=1742648519\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2078790/extras/fff81f2151903d97ed83c4099bf81191.mp4?t=1742648519\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>   </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Diverse Levels</strong>: Tackle 9 unique normal levels, 4 challenging bonus levels.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>~Customization</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Unlock and choose from over 30 different skins to personalize your cube.<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2078790/extras/1c32d99483e56db15e3bf81a138b50c7.poster.avif?t=1742648519\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2078790/extras/1c32d99483e56db15e3bf81a138b50c7.webm?t=1742648519\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2078790/extras/1c32d99483e56db15e3bf81a138b50c7.mp4?t=1742648519\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Simple, Cartoonish 3D Graphics</strong>: Enjoy a visually appealing game with a charming and straightforward aesthetic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Continuous Updates</strong>: Stay tuned for updates that will expand the story and introduce new content to keep the game fresh and exciting.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>~Conclusion</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you're a casual gamer looking for a fun way to pass the time or a hardcore gamer seeking a new challenge, <strong>Kubitoz </strong>promises to deliver an unforgettable gaming experience. Get ready to dodge, weave, and conquer the obstacles that await you!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2078790/extras/61817f8d815eafb76332c3e0a994f165.avif?t=1742648519\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to <strong>Kubitoz</strong> \u2013 an exhilarating 3D adventure where you take control of a cube navigating through a series of challenging obstacle courses. Each level presents unique difficulties and mechanics designed to keep you on the edge of your seat. With its simple yet charming cartoony 3D style, Kubitoz offers a visually delightful and engaging experience for players of all ages.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>~Fast-Paced Challenge of Reflexes and Strategy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> In <strong>Kubitoz</strong>, your primary objective is to dodge obstacles and reach the end of each level. The game is designed to be challenging, pushing your reflexes and strategic thinking to the limit. As you progress, you'll encounter new mechanics that add layers of fun and complexity to the gameplay, ensuring that no two levels feel the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2078790/extras/fff81f2151903d97ed83c4099bf81191.poster.avif?t=1742648519\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2078790/extras/fff81f2151903d97ed83c4099bf81191.webm?t=1742648519\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2078790/extras/fff81f2151903d97ed83c4099bf81191.mp4?t=1742648519\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>   </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Diverse Levels</strong>: Tackle 9 unique normal levels, 4 challenging bonus levels.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>~Customization</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Unlock and choose from over 30 different skins to personalize your cube.<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2078790/extras/1c32d99483e56db15e3bf81a138b50c7.poster.avif?t=1742648519\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2078790/extras/1c32d99483e56db15e3bf81a138b50c7.webm?t=1742648519\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2078790/extras/1c32d99483e56db15e3bf81a138b50c7.mp4?t=1742648519\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Simple, Cartoonish 3D Graphics</strong>: Enjoy a visually appealing game with a charming and straightforward aesthetic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Continuous Updates</strong>: Stay tuned for updates that will expand the story and introduce new content to keep the game fresh and exciting.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>~Conclusion</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you're a casual gamer looking for a fun way to pass the time or a hardcore gamer seeking a new challenge, <strong>Kubitoz </strong>promises to deliver an unforgettable gaming experience. Get ready to dodge, weave, and conquer the obstacles that await you!</p>",
    "short_description": "Dodge obstacles and conquer challenging levels as a cube in Kubitoz! Enjoy fast-paced, adrenaline-pumping action with charming 3D cartoon graphics and over 30 customizable skins. Ready for endless fun and excitement? Jump in and start dodging!",
